<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>futboey</Major>
    <Description>Turn your Minecraft sessions into an adrenaline-filled race! With our «Fast Bridge» macro, you can build bridges faster and safer than ever. Simply step to the edge of a block, hold down the Shift key, activate the macro, and watch your bridge take shape in no time. Once you're done, release Shift and continue exploring with ease!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 225 1
Delay 100 ms
RightDown 1
Delay 1 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 1 ms
KeyUp 225 1
Delay 200 ms
KeyDown 225 1
Delay 100 ms
RightDown 1
Delay 1 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 1 ms
